   "titulo": "Putting the important thing in front of you",
   "texto": [
    "To highlight something, put it at the beginning of the sentence. The conjugated verb remains second: **Den bog har jeg læst.** = That book I have read.",
    "The normal would be: **Jeg har læst den bog.**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "If you start with something else",
   "texto": [
    "When the phrase begins with another element (a place, a time, an object), the subject goes after the verb: **Hver dag går hun en tur.** = Every day he takes a walk.",
    "It is the same rule as ever: the verb always in second place."
   ]
